          "filename": "Burry Port & Gwendraeth Valley site of Station 1973645 e4156820.jpg",
          "caption": "Site of Burry Port (Burry Port &amp; Gwendraeth Valley) Station.\nView eastward, at probable site of Burry Port (BP&amp;GV) Station? The view seems to be eastward towards Llanelli, the visible tracks being those of the ex-Great Western South Wales main line, Swansea - Llanelli - Carmarthen etc. The passenger service on the BP&amp;GV line, Cwmmawr - Burry Port ceased on 21/9/53, but minerals were conveyed, including on to Llanelli Docks, until about 1991. [I would welcome suggestions to clarify this one!]",
          "alt": "Site of Burry Port (Burry Port &amp; Gwendraeth Valley) Station.\nView eastward, at probable site of Burry Port (BP&amp;GV) Station? The view seems to be eastward towards Llanelli, the visible tracks being those of the ex-Great Western South Wales main line, Swansea - Llanelli - Carmarthen etc. The passenger service on the BP&amp;GV line, Cwmmawr - Burry Port ceased on 21/9/53, but minerals were conveyed, including on to Llanelli Docks, until about 1991. [I would welcome suggestions to clarify this one!]",
